Bound native-fullscreen polling on yabai's serial event loop.

Base: https://github.com/asmvik/yabai/commit/dd845723416f5fe92af49fad5ebab00369e07edd
Apply after macos-27.patch, whose fullscreen code comes from:
https://github.com/AhsanFazal/yabai/commit/ad0a12d63f639534a296a1d065b0d04979f1b4db

Use one five-second monotonic deadline for focus and transition polling.
Wait for the target display's fullscreen Space on entry and a user Space on
exit. Propagate AX failures and timeouts to command clients, and do not tile
an exiting window before the transition completes.

